<view class="page"><view class="title">学生实名认证</view><view class="subtitle">核验本校学籍，保护校园交易环境</view><view class="panel section"><view class="row"><text>{{school}}</text><text class="badge {{status === 'PENDING' ? 'warning' : ''}}">{{statusText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{status === 'PENDING'}}" class="safe-note">资料已提交，请等待管理员审核。审核结果可在这里查看。</view><view wx:if="{{status === 'VERIFIED'}}" class="safe-note">已通过认证，可以发布商品。<view>学号：{{maskedStudentId}}</view><view>手机号：{{maskedPhone}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{rejectionReason}}" class="error">审核未通过：{{rejectionReason}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{status === 'UNVERIFIED' || status === 'REJECTED'}}" class="panel"><view class="field"><text class="field-label">姓名</text><input data-field="realName" value="{{realName}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="与学籍一致的姓名" maxlength="30"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">学号</text><input data-field="studentId" value="{{studentId}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写本校学号" maxlength="20"/></view><view class="field"><text class="field-label">手机号</text><input data-field="phone" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="input" placeholder="填写11位手机号" type="number" maxlength="11"/></view><view class="safe-note">信息仅用于学生身份审核，学号不会向其他用户公开；个人页仅显示脱敏内容。</view><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">提交审核</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view>
